            "review_title": "Review at Ishidai - Soramen & Sushi",
            "review_text": "Sơn Đông L\n1 contribution\n1\nA Cozy Japanese Spot in the Heart of Saigon – A Must Visit!\nSep 2025 • Friends\nI just tried out this cute little Japanese place in District 1, and I was really impressed! The space is small but super cozy, kind of like stepping into a little corner of Japan in the middle of Saigon. What really stood out was how friendly the owner and staff were—they were all so nice and genuinely took the time to explain each dish, which made the experience even better.\n\nThe somen noodles with Wagyu A5 is a must-try. The noodles are perfectly soft, and the Wagyu A5 melts in your mouth. It's one of those dishes that feels special and totally worth the try.\n\nI’ll definitely be back not just for the great food, but also for the awesome service. If you're looking for a great meal in a chill spot, this place is definitely worth checking out!\nRead more\nWritten September 26, 2025",
